\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces The evaluation protocol, left to right, and where each condition's belief lives. Twenty-four held-out topics, two sides each, seed a stance per condition row; five escalating pressure levels, three rounds apiece, are scored by a judge that sees only the transcript, blind to condition. The condition rows show the manipulation directly: A{} and C{} carry no belief text in context, B{} and D{} carry the full belief as text, F{} carries a small curated slot alongside the compiled tensors, and S carries a fixed activation-space direction instead of either.}}{6}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:setup}{{3}{6}{The evaluation protocol, left to right, and where each condition's belief lives. Twenty-four held-out topics, two sides each, seed a stance per condition row; five escalating pressure levels, three rounds apiece, are scored by a judge that sees only the transcript, blind to condition. The condition rows show the manipulation directly: \condA {} and \condC {} carry no belief text in context, \condB {} and \condD {} carry the full belief as text, \condF {} carries a small curated slot alongside the compiled tensors, and S carries a fixed activation-space direction instead of either}{figure.caption.5}{}}
